#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
btc5m_daxue_live.py — Polymarket BTC 5m 「大数投资」DAXUE live strategy

Translate 齐东平 A-share 大数投资 principles into BTC 5m binary:
  1. Low cost / 低估值: BUY only when ask ∈ [ASK_MIN, ASK_MAX] (default 0.22–0.40)
  2. Side from spot vs window open (UP if spot>open+tol, DOWN if spot<open-tol)
  3. 大数 diversify: ≤1 new entry per 5m window; max concurrent cost ≤ floor(2/3*bankroll)
  4. Hold to settlement by default; optional EARLY_EXIT FOK SELL when bid≥min
  5. 永续/逆向 light: never chase ask > ASK_MAX
  6. Post-window BUY banned (left<=0 or now>=market_end)
  7. Hard BUY cap: place_order market buy with maxPrice=decision_ask+slip (FOK)

Does NOT restart / depend on GUIDED_LIVE lag+SR filters.
Orders via node place_order.mjs (POLY_1271 OWNER path). Never prints private keys.

Reviews / PnL: use btc5m_poly_settle.py (Gamma actual outcome via outcomePrices /
umaResolutionStatus). Do NOT use next-window-open as W/L. Five-trade review CLI:
daxue_five_trade_review.py. Edge snapshot: daxue_edge_snapshot.py.

Capital protection (保本金→验边→日收益), env-tunable:
  DAY_LOSS_STOP (default $7), CONSEC_LOSS_PAUSE (3), PAUSE_MIN (30),
  BIG_WIN_LOCK ($6) + LOCK_GAINS (1): lock day after one settled leg PnL > BIG_WIN_LOCK.
  DAY_PROFIT_LOCK ($15): lock when (day_pnl_settled − profit_lock_baseline) ≥ $15; unlock resets baseline.
  DAILY_TARGET_SOFT legacy unused. State: logs/daxue_day_state_YYYYMMDD.json.
  prune_settled frees deploy AND Gamma-updates day_pnl / loss streak when resolved.

Risk filters (env-tunable):
  OVERNIGHT_PAUSE Asia/Shanghai [OVERNIGHT_PAUSE_START_H, OVERNIGHT_PAUSE_END_H)
    default 00:00–08:00 — no NEW entries; settle/logging/heartbeats continue.
  ADVERSE_SLIP / stale-cheap-fill: before FOK, re-check book estimate vs decision_ask;
    SKIP if (decision_ask − est_fill) ≥ ADVERSE_SLIP (default 0.08) OR
    (decision_ask ≥ STALE_ASK_MIN 0.35 and est_fill ≤ STALE_FILL_MAX 0.27).
    Env: ADVERSE_SLIP / DAXUE_ADVERSE_SLIP, STALE_ASK_MIN, STALE_FILL_MAX.
  POST-CHASE BAND STABILITY: after ask > ASK_MAX (chase-ban) on a slug, require
    ask ∈ [ASK_MIN, ASK_MAX] for ENTRY_STABLE_TICKS consecutive polls (default 3,
    ≈9s at POLL_SEC=3) before ENTRY — anti plunge-entry right as ask falls back.
    Log [DAXUE][SKIP] band-unstable ... while streak < N. Env: ENTRY_STABLE_TICKS.
  WEAK TREND FILTER (not the main signal; side still from spot vs window open ±tol):
    Allow ENTRY only when 1h and 4h BTC spot change directions agree with each other
    AND with intended side (UP=uptrend, DOWN=downtrend). If 1h vs 4h disagree → SKIP;
    if they agree but oppose side → SKIP. Missing 1h/4h prices → fail-open (ALLOW).
    Log [DAXUE][SKIP] trend_filter ... when blocking. Env: TREND_FILTER / DAXUE_TREND_FILTER (default OFF).
  LATE RECLAIM SKIP (hard; default ON):
    In the last LATE_RECLAIM_SEC of the 5m window (default 120s), do NOT buy the
    currently-favored mid-path side that matches spot vs window open — that cheap
    favorite often reclaims into settle (e.g. mid-dip bought DOWN, then spot reclaims
    above open → UP wins). Hard SKIP (not soft):
      rem_sec < LATE_RECLAIM_SEC AND side==DOWN AND spot < open → SKIP
      rem_sec < LATE_RECLAIM_SEC AND side==UP   AND spot > open → SKIP
    Log [DAXUE][SKIP] late_reclaim ... when blocking.
    Env: LATE_RECLAIM_SKIP / DAXUE_LATE_RECLAIM_SKIP (default ON),
         LATE_RECLAIM_SEC / DAXUE_LATE_RECLAIM_SEC (default 120).
  EARLY EXIT (experimental, env-tunable):
    After a live BUY, if best bid reaches [EARLY_EXIT_BID_MIN, EARLY_EXIT_BID_MAX]
    (default 0.85–0.99), attempt ONE FOK SELL with minPrice=EARLY_EXIT_BID_MIN
    via place_order.mjs. Do not chase below min; bid_max is logging/trigger band.
    Success → free slot + record realized PnL into day_risk (no Gamma double-count).
    Fail / never reaches band → keep hold-to-settle. Logs [EARLY_EXIT] success/fail.
    Env: EARLY_EXIT / DAXUE_EARLY_EXIT, EARLY_EXIT_BID_MIN, EARLY_EXIT_BID_MAX.
"""

